<%- include('header', { title: 'Sign in — Hụi' }) %>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ringside">
      <div id="herochart"></div>
      <p class="ringcap" id="herocap"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h1 class="lede">Everyone pays in. One takes the pot. Next cycle, the next person.</h1>
      <p>
        That is a hụi — the savings circle that has funded shops, weddings and school fees across
        South East Asia for generations, on nothing but trust and a paper book.
      </p>
      <p>
        This app keeps the book. It works out who is owed the pot, records who paid on time, and gives
        every member a reliability score they can carry into the next circle.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap entry">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="tabs inset">
        <button class="tab active" data-mode="signin" type="button">Sign in</button>
        <button class="tab" data-mode="register" type="button">Create account</button>
      </div>
      <p class="invitenote" id="resetnote" hidden>Enter the email you signed up with and the new password you want. You will be signed in straight away.</p>
      <p class="invitenote" id="invitenote" hidden>You have been invited to a circle. Sign in or create an account and we will take you straight to it.</p>
      <form id="authform">
        <label class="field reg-only" hidden>
          <span>Full name</span>
          <input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80">
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>Email</span>
          <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="120">
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span id="pwlabel">Password</span>
          <input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required minlength="8" maxlength="200">
          <small class="hint" id="pwhint" hidden>At least 8 characters, with an uppercase letter, a lowercase letter and a digit.</small>
        </label>
        <button class="primary" type="submit">Sign in</button>
        <p class="error" id="autherror" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <button class="link" id="forgotlink" type="button">Forgot your password?</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2>What the reliability score is for</h2>
      <p>
        A hụi only works if the people in it pay. Traditionally you learn that the hard way, once,
        and the circle never recovers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Here every contribution is logged against its due date, so each member carries a number from
        0 to 100. A new member starts at 50 — neither trusted nor doubted. One early payment cannot buy
        a perfect record, and one late payment does not wipe out a good one.
      </p>
      <p class="muted small">
        Due dates skip weekends and national public holidays, so nobody is marked late for a day the
        banks were shut.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('footer') %>
